ww.techradar.com/news/wordle-today\">Wordle today</a> page).</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Marc is TechRadar’s Global Editor in Chief, the latest in a long line of senior editorial roles he’s held in a career that started the week that Google launched (nice of them to mark the occasion).","zh":null},{"en":"Prior to joining TR, he was UK Editor in Chief on Tom’s Guide, where he oversaw all gaming, streaming, audio, TV, entertainment, how-to and cameras coverage.","zh":null},{"en":"He's also a former editor of the tech website Stuff and spent five years at the music magazine NME, where his duties mainly involved spoiling other people’s fun.","zh":null},{"en":"He’s based in London, and has tested and written about phones, tablets, wearables, streaming boxes, smart home devices, Bluetooth speakers, headphones, games, TVs, cameras and pretty much every other type of gadget you can think of.","zh":null},{"en":"An avid photographer, Marc likes nothing better than taking pictures of very small things (bugs, his daughters) or very big things (distant galaxies).","zh":null},{"en":"He also enjoys live music, gaming, cycling, and beating Wordle (he authors the daily Wordle today page).","zh":null}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"content\" data-widget-type=\"contentparsed\">\n<section>\n<div>\n<figure>\n<picture data-new-v2-image=\"true\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-1920-80.jpg.webp 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-1600-80.jpg.webp 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-1200-80.jpg.webp 1200w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-1024-80.jpg.webp 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-970-80.jpg.webp 970w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-750-80.jpg.webp 750w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-650-80.jpg.webp 650w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-480-80.jpg.webp 480w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-320-80.jpg.webp 320w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 600px, 100vw\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT.jpg\" alt=\"Three TVs on a blue background next to text reading TechRadar Black Friday deals\" srcset=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-1920-80.jpg 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-1600-80.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-1200-80.jpg 1200w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-1024-80.jpg 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-970-80.jpg 970w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-750-80.jpg 750w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-650-80.jpg 650w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-480-80.jpg 480w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT-320-80.jpg 320w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 600px, 100vw\" data-new-v2-image=\"true\" data-original-mos=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT.jpg\" data-pin-media=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/ybikbwNAbCKszVCM22MAZT.jpg\" data-pin-nopin=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"high\" data-component-name=\"Image\">\n</picture>\n<figcaption>(Image credit: Amazon/TechRadar)</figcaption>\n</figure></div>\n\n<div id=\"article-body\">\n\n<p id=\"elk-9b9a2964-e405-11f1-b1d3-df51c07c9ef0\">Black Friday is the ideal time to treat yourself to a TV upgrade. Deals always come thick and fast at this time of year, and though there's still eight days to go until Black Friday itself, there are already some huge savings to be had.</p><p>• See all today's best Black Friday deals</p><p>For instance, you can get the five-star rated 65-inch LG C6 at Walmart for $1,349 — that's a massive $1,350 off the list price and a true bargain for an incredible OLED TV. Or, at the other end of the scale, you can snap up a smart Fire TV at Amazon for only $69 — perfect for a kids' bedroom or a kitchen.</p><p>Below, you'll find all of the best offers we've hunted down so far, across all sizes and price points.</p><h3 id=\"section-black-friday-tv-deals-quick-links\">Black Friday TV deals — quick links</h3><ul id=\"elk-89075e4a-e412-11f1-9cce-473d9e72aafb\"><li>Amazon: smart TVs from $69.99</li><li>Best Buy: $1,000 off 4K, QLED &amp; OLED TVs</li><li>OLED TVs: from $599.99 at Best Buy</li><li>Samsung: Up to $1,500 off 4K, OLED &amp; QLED TVs</li><li>Target: smart TV deals from $89</li><li>Walmart: big-screen 4K TVs from $298</li></ul><h2 id=\"the-best-black-friday-tv-deals-right-now-3\">The best Black Friday TV deals right now</h2><hr data-component-name=\"UI:CMS:Divider\" data-palette=\"brand\" id=\"elk-9b9a2c34-e405-11f1-b6ed-add8cfccc9d0\"><h2 id=\"thinking-of-buying-a-new-tv-3\">考虑购买新电视吗？</h2><p id=\"elk-9b9a2d10-e405-11f1-9ac4-cbee96196469\">尝试我们的电视尺寸和型号查找器！ 您告诉它您离电视有多远，我们会根据图像质量专家的视角建议告诉您要购买什么尺寸，并且我们会以不同的价格推荐该尺寸的三款顶级电视。</p><a href=\"https://news.google.com/publications/CAAqKAgKIiJDQklTRXdnTWFnOEtEWFJsWTJoeVlXUmhjaTVqYjIwb0FBUAE?hl=en-GB&gl=GB&ceid=GB%3Aen\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"elk-9b9a2dec-e405-11f1-8228-4332a56c91c3\" data-url=\"https://news.google.com/publications/CAAqKAgKIiJDQklTRXdnTWFnOEtEWFJsWTJoeVlXUmhjaTVqYjIwb0FBUAE?hl=en-GB&gl=GB&ceid=GB%3Aen\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" data-hl-processed=\"none\" data-article-category=\"televisions\"><figure data-bordeaux-image-check=\"\"><div><p> <picture data-new-v2-image=\"true\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-676-80.jpg.webp 1200w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-676-80.jpg.webp 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-676-80.jpg.webp 970w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-650-80.jpg.webp 650w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-480-80.jpg.webp 480w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-320-80.jpg.webp 320w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 970px, calc(100vw - 40px)\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78.jpg\" alt=\"Google logo on a black background next to text reading 'Click to follow TechRadar'\" srcset=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-676-80.jpg 1200w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-676-80.jpg 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-676-80.jpg 970w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-650-80.jpg 650w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-480-80.jpg 480w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78-320-80.jpg 320w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 970px, calc(100vw - 40px)\" loading=\"lazy\" data-new-v2-image=\"true\" data-original-mos=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78.jpg\" data-pin-media=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/diM9tpwF2Lz85R8q85CT78.jpg\">\n</picture></p></div></figure></a><p id=\"elk-9b9a2e5a-e405-11f1-82f9-094222764d0d\">在 Google 新闻上关注 TechRadar，并将我们添加为首选来源，以便在您的 Feed 中获取我们的专家新闻、评论和意见。</p>\n</div>\n\n<div data-hydrate=\"true\" id=\"slice-container-newsletterForm-articleInbodyContent-uzzM8Sfh3bzc9gF9Bgs7hV\"><section><p>订阅突发新闻、评论、观点、顶级技术交易等。</p></section></div>\n\n\n\n<div data-author-bio-read-less=\"Read less\" data-author-bio-read-more=\"Read more\" data-author-bio-max-height=\"250\" id=\"slice-container-authorBio-uzzM8Sfh3bzc9gF9Bgs7hV\" data-component-name=\"Slice:AuthorBio\">\n<p>Marc is TechRadar’s Global Editor in Chief, the latest in a long line of senior editorial roles he’s held in a career that started the week that Google launched (nice of them to mark the occasion). Prior to joining TR, he was UK Editor in Chief on Tom’s Guide, where he oversaw all gaming, streaming, audio, TV, entertainment, how-to and cameras coverage. He's also a former editor of the tech website Stuff and spent five years at the music magazine NME, where his duties mainly involved spoiling other people’s fun. He’s based in London, and has tested and written about phones, tablets, wearables, streaming boxes, smart home devices, Bluetooth speakers, headphones, games, TVs, cameras and pretty much every other type of gadget you can think of. An avid photographer, Marc likes nothing better than taking pictures of very small things (bugs, his daughters) or very big things (distant galaxies). He also enjoys live music, gaming, cycling, and beating Wordle (he authors the daily Wordle today page).</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div>"}